# Disruptor Pistol: "{4}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: It deals 5 damage to target creature."
# The {4} is paid exactly. Turn 1 casts five Moxen and the {2} Pistol, paid with two of them, leaving three
# untapped: the ability is not offered then (Mana: short), and on turn 3 four tapped Moxen pay it and empty the
# pool. The target may be an opponent's creature (Fortress Crab, 1/6), which takes exactly 5 damage and survives
# with 5 marked (CR 120.3, 120.3e). A noncreature permanent, Mox Pearl, is refused (CR 115.1). The artifact is
# sacrificed as part of the cost (CR 602.2b, 118.3), so it is in the graveyard.

